.el .ds Aq '
.TH ag-push 1  "push 0.3.0-beta.6"
.SH NAME
ag\-push \- Upload your snapshot and open a proposal on the server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag push\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-stream\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-task\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-title\fR> [\fIREV\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Upload your snapshot and open a proposal on the server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\fR \fI<REMOTE>\fR
Remote name (default: origin)
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
Proposal title
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR [default: ]
Longer description
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-\-stream\fR \fI<STREAM>\fR
Target stream (default: the repository\*(Aqs default stream)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-\-task\fR \fI<TASK>\fR
Task this proposal belongs to
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIREV\fR]
Revision to propose (default: the workspace head)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.6
